cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Capture-session evaluation protocol and recoverability-audit tools
  for the durian disease benchmark
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying dataset, please cite
  both, and group your evaluation by the session column. The dataset
  DOI below is the one to cite for the images and the capture-session
  identifiers.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lin
    given-names: Ding Shan
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6031-8479
    affiliation: UCSI University
